profile.comment=\
	§a★ Paragon§r: The flagship style of Steadfast.. \
	Colorful and pleasing, Paragon unifies the Semi-Natural (daytime) and \
	Fantasy (nighttime) styles and is the very best that Steadfast has to \
	offer.\n\n\
	\
	§d🪄 Fantasy§r: A warm style emphasizing blue and yellow.. \
	Fantasy draws inspiration from the classic look of Chocapic13's shaders \
	and edits like Sildur's shaders.\n\n\
	\
	§b⛰ Semi-Natural§r: A bright, realism-focused style.. \
	Semi-Natural draws inspiration from the brighter, colder aesthetic of the \
	SEUS v10.1 era, and approximates a more "natural" / "realistic" look.\n\n\
	\
	§6😎 Retro§r: A warm, cozy, and very lightweight style.. \
	A throwback to 2012 shaders, Retro features weakened contrast between the \
	sun and shadows, no directional shading from sunlight (like internal \
	shaders), and the vanilla water texture.\n\n\
	\
	§b🔥 High§r / §a» Medium§r / §e↓ Low§r / §c▶ Toaster§r - Pre-tuned \
	tradeoffs between quality and performance allowing you to adapt Steadfast \
	to your device..

